# 47b) `vuna test` 的效果路径超时：1ms 的用例照常通过，30s 长睡眠用例按 8s 超时失败，
#      进程不挂死，失败文案带 `timed out after 8s`。
run: VUNA_TEST_TIMEOUT=8 "$VUNA" test corpus/cli/timeout_hang 2>&1
exit: 1
out-contains: ok   timeout_quick.vuna
out-contains: FAIL timeout_sleep.vuna: timed out after 8s
out-contains: 1 passed, 1 failed